  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Steps to reproduce:\n1) Be in full body tracking (required)\n2) Playspace move up and down\n3) Make sound while someone else listens\nYour voice will not follow your avatars head, and will instead come from where your head would be if you had not moved up.\nThis may seem easy to write off as \"Don't use Playspace Mover,\" but this will break things like moving around in your real playspace too.\nHere's a video demonstrating this problem;\nhttps://youtu.be/7RDdcF_tjv4",
